{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_callbacks_callback_hell_callback_hell", "label": "Callback hell", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/callbacks/callback-hell.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nesting is forced because a callback has no return value to sequence on. The real cost is per-level error handling, not indentation."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_callbacks_callback_hell_named_functions_not_the_fix", "label": "Named functions do not fix callback hell", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/callbacks/callback-hell.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hoisting removes indentation and nothing else: sequence becomes invisible, closures are lost, per-level if(err) remains, trust bugs remain."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_callbacks_callback_hell_promise_return_value_fix", "label": "Promise as the return-value fix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/callbacks/callback-hell.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A real fix must give the operation a return value representing the eventual result so steps sequence by return rather than by call."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_callbacks_callback_hell_callback_hell", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_callbacks_inversion_of_control_inversion_of_control", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/callbacks/callback-hell.html", "source_location": nu